sequenceDiagram
    %% search with embeddings and salience
    participant caller as Caller
    participant engine as Engine
    participant embed as Embedder
    participant index as Index
    caller->>+engine: search_engrams
    engine->>+embed: embed the query
    embed-->>-engine: vector
    par by text
        engine->>index: full text
        index-->>engine: rows
    and by meaning
        engine->>index: nearest vectors
        index-->>engine: rows
    end
    engine->>engine: rank, lift by salience
    engine-->>-caller: hits with snippets
